        <Node Name="Delegate (Region,Fuse,2-&gt;2)" Aspects="Internal" Bounds="783,930" Id="JxPHgZpakz8QU7iVz1ongO" Summary="Delegate a function that takes two ShaderNode values as inputs and returns two ShaderNode values as a result" Remarks="By using a delegate we can defer our input to decide to call the same function in different ways in different places" Tags="f22">
